This repository contains a partial copy of ros2_astra_camera. Only the
files that were changed for this project are redistributed here; they are
intended to replace the corresponding files in an upstream checkout of
ros2_astra_camera before rebuilding the astra_camera package.

The following files are derived from ros2_astra_camera and HAVE BEEN
MODIFIED from their original form:

    ros2_astra_camera/astra_camera/include/astra_camera/ob_camera_node.h
    ros2_astra_camera/astra_camera/include/astra_camera/uvc_camera_driver.h
    ros2_astra_camera/astra_camera/src/ob_camera_node.cpp
    ros2_astra_camera/astra_camera/src/uvc_camera_driver.cpp

Each modified file carries a modification notice in its header, and the
individual changes are marked in-line with "Modification:" comments, as
required by section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Summary of modifications (Ray Wang Rui Hua, 2026-07-22):

  * Added two atomic privacy-mode flags, blur_ and selective_blur_, to
    OBCameraNode, together with a subscription to the /voice topic that
    cycles between blurring disabled, full-frame blur and selective blur.
  * Extended the UVCCameraDriver constructor to accept pointers to those
    two flags, replacing the earlier single privacy-mode flag.
  * Added a full-frame Gaussian blur stage to the UVC frame callback,
    applied to published colour frames while blur_ is set.
  * Added a selective blur stage that runs a YOLOv8 face-detection model
    via OpenCV DNN and applies a Gaussian blur to detected face bounding
    boxes while selective_blur_ is set, including the setupYOLO() helper
    that loads the ONNX model from the package share directory.
  * Added the supporting OpenCV, cv_bridge and ament_index_cpp includes
    and the BLUR_AMT blur-kernel constant.

